('APX-S-3181-2', 'APX-C-3181', 2, 3, 8, 5, ': [Floral Warm Tone - Sweet Idol] Action: She takes out a pink perfume bottle from behind her and draws a circle in the air, spinning her body along the circle. Transformation: As she rotates, the suit shatters into thousands of petals, turning into a pink lace sequin dress. Environment: Warm sunset, cherry blossom special effects floating in the air.', '[Floral Warm Tone - Sweet Idol] She takes out a pink perfume bottle from behind her and draws a circle in the air, spinning her body along the circle.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
