Sound Effects: Instantly switch from muffled underwater sounds to high-pitched electronic music climax.', '[Ocean Tone - Agile Mermaid] She pours a bottle of blue perfume directly onto the lens (special effect), creating an "entering water" sensation. She wears a sea-blue laser-textured long dress, wet hair look, and pearls on her cheekbones.', null, 'pouring', null, null, 'ocean', null)
