('APX-S-5532-1', 'APX-C-5532', 1, null, null, null, 'Scene / Setting Night. Large abandoned Indian hospital corridor. Flickering fluorescent lights. Rusted wheelchairs, peeling paint, old hospital signs, long empty hallway stretching into darkness. Everything clearly visible. Camera Handheld smartphone footage. Medium shot from behind and beside an elderly Indian woman sitting in a wheelchair.', 'Large abandoned Indian hospital corridor. Flickering fluorescent lights. Rusted wheelchairs, peeling paint, old hospital signs, long empty hallway stretching into darkness. Everything clearly visible. Camera smartphone footage.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5532-2', 'APX-C-5532', 2, null, null, null, 'The woman watches her leave. Silence. At the far end of the corridor is a distant cross-passage. The elderly woman stares toward it. A figure slowly appears. An extremely thin Indian woman wearing a tattered hospital gown. Pale decaying skin with visible veins. Long tangled black hair hanging over her face.', 'The woman watches her leave. Long tangled black hair hanging over her face.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5532-3', 'APX-C-5532', 3, null, null, null, 'Milky white unfocused eyes. Large sharp fangs visible. She slowly walks across the distant opening. Not looking toward the wheelchair. Just passing by. Her movement feels wrong. Too stiff. Too slow. She disappears behind the wall. Silence. The elderly woman continues staring. Nothing happens. She slowly relaxes.', 'She slowly walks across the distant opening. Her movement feels wrong. She disappears behind the wall.', null, null, null, null, null, null),
('APX-S-5532-4', 'APX-C-5532', 4, null, null, null, 'A sigh of relief. Then— A faint scratching sound from above. The woman looks confused. Another scratching sound. Closer. She slowly looks upward. Hanging upside down directly above her wheelchair is the same woman. Milky white eyes. Decaying skin. Hair hanging downward. Fangs exposed. The woman suddenly drops from the ceiling directly in front of the wheelchair and releases a violent scream.', 'The woman looks confused. Hanging upside down directly above her wheelchair is the same woman. The woman suddenly drops from the ceiling directly in front of the wheelchair and releases a violent scream.', null, null, null, null, null, null)
on conflict (shot_id) do nothing;

